{
 "id": "0e7b4b35-cb2a-410f-97d3-78b38da56bd9",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "I've been reincarnated as a villainous young lady to protect my feet"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "I'm a mean stepsister who is likely to get what she deserves from Cinderella"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "シンデレラに「ざまぁ」されそうな意地悪な義姉です～転生した私は足を守るため悪役令嬢になります～"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"I'm going to chop off your leg!\" \"Ugh!\" I woke up from a nightmare to find myself as a beautiful girl in a strange mansion! I thought my reincarnation gacha was a huge success☆, but it turns out that my true identity is the spiteful stepsister from the fairy tale \"Cinderella.\" In the story, there is a tragic route in which my stepsister gets her leg chopped off. And Cinderella, who is supposed to be kind-hearted, is screaming that she wants revenge on me. If this continues, will I really get my leg chopped off?! The key to avoiding the tragic route is the existence of a wizard and for me to become the \"villainous daughter\"?! A leg-or-die fantasy story!",
   "ja": "「お前の足を、ちょん斬ってやるッ！」「うぎぃえあああああ！？」悪夢から覚めた私は、見知らぬ屋敷で美少女になっていた！　転生ガチャ大成功☆……と思いきや、その正体は童話『シンデレラ』の意地悪な義姉。物語の中では、義姉が足をちょん斬られる惨劇ルートが存在して——。しかも心優しいはずのシンデレラは、私に復讐したいと叫んでる。このままだと私、本当に足ちょん斬られちゃう！？　惨劇ルート回避の鍵は、魔法使いの存在と、私が『悪役令嬢になる』こと！？　レッグ（足）・オア・ダイなファンタジーストーリー！"
  },
